Figshare publishes academic research data online. \tbcode{figshare-meta} is a
new \LaTeX\ package for parsing and typesetting Figshare metadata. The Figshare
\acro{API}, \acro{JSON} metadata and the \tbcode{jsonparse} package were
combined into a Figshare metadata workflow. This work was designed to support
researchers, librarians, repository managers, or anyone else integrating
Figshare metadata and \LaTeX.
